---
// ABOUT - editorial dua kolom. Copy disetujui, disusun ulang jadi narasi,
// bukan daftar riwayat (riwayat ada di Experience/Education).
---

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">01 / Orientation</span>
        <h2 class="h2">A Little About My Journey</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="mono section-head__note">Authenticity / Practical Foundation / Continuous Evolution</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__quote reveal">
        <span class="num about__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <blockquote>
          Never minimize potential, never exaggerate experience. Build ground-up technical
          competence with relentless curiosity.
        </blockquote>
        <p class="body">
          I am driven by practical problems where analytical thinking, structured systems,
          and emerging automated tools intersect. Every endeavor starts with solid
          fundamentals and disciplined execution.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about__text">
        <p class="lead reveal" style="--stagger:0">
          My foundation is vocational: Computer and Network Engineering at SMK Negeri 1
          Sukoharjo, followed by four months of field internship at Soerya Global Komputer.
          That path gave me hands-on hardware diagnostics, operating system deployment, and
          the habit of documenting work so someone else can repeat it.
        </p>
        <p class="body reveal" style="--stagger:1">
          I now spend most of my time with applied artificial intelligence, AI-assisted
          software pipelines, Indonesian computational linguistics, model evaluation, and
          workflow automation. The through line is the same: understand the system, then
          make it do useful work.
        </p>
        <p class="body reveal" style="--stagger:2">
          I am interested in collaborative roles that combine technology infrastructure,
          data evaluation, language processing, and pragmatic operational problem-solving.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .about__quote {
    position: relative;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .about__num {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 20px;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
  }
  .about__quote blockquote {
    position: relative;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    max-width: 26ch;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .about__text > p + p { margin-top: 20px; }
  .about__text { max-width: 62ch; }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      gap: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .about__quote { padding: 40px 36px; }
  }
</style>
